| `list[0] = Complex(3, -1);` | `5 + 2 * i: 5.38516` |
| `list[1] = Complex(5, 2);` | `1 - 7 * i: 7.07107` |
| `list[2] = Complex(1, -7);` | `6 + 8 * i: 10` |
| `list[3] = Complex(6, 8);` | `Number of comparision (on Complex): 7` |
